<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank sells stake in Isarwerke GmbH.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank sells stake in Isarwerke GmbH.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel- Bank AG said on Friday it was selling its 14 percent stake in Isarwerke GmbH to electrical utility Bayernwerk AG with effect from June 30.</p>
<p>Hypo-Bank made the announcement in a mandatory statement. It did not disclose the sale price.</p>
<p>Isarwerke GmbH has a majority stake in Isar-Amperwerke AG . Bayernwerk AG is a unit of Viag AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
